        { "cell": "clock", "text": "Soundtracks - il cinema alla radio, at 8:40, 15:10 and 23:00;" },
        { "cell": "signs", "text": "Maaĩ (kana 'Vatten' na rũthiomi rwa 'Kĩswedeni'), nĩ mũthemba wa kĩndũ gĩtweku kĩna mwaraha wa 70% thĩĩ ng'ima. Bũrũri Gĩkũyũ nĩ warathirwo nĩ Mwene Nyaga akĩhe Agĩkũyũ maĩ na gĩthaka. Chemical formula ya maĩ nĩ H 2 O." },
        { "cell": "signs", "text": ">> Kenda Mũihũru: rũgano rwa gĩkũyũ na mũmbi (' Okweshumi na rũthiomi rwa Kĩthũrũ)" },
        { "cell": "signs", "text": ">> Kũrĩmĩrũra Mbũgĩ: ũteti wa thiomi \"decolonising the mind: politics of language\"" },
        { "cell": "signs", "text": "C-K irugamira concepts na Knowledge. kwo no ituo mathugunda na ugi. Niri garuri ithatu na nicio k-->k, kugarura ugi ugatuka ugi ugi, K-->C, C-->K na C---> C." },
        { "cell": "signs", "text": "Iria ria Indiannirio iria ria gatatu hari unene gatagati-ini wa maria ma thi, riikariire muigana wa 70,560,000 (ta 20% ya mai ma thi). Rihakanite na Asia mwena wa ruguru, Africa mwena wa ithuiro, Australia mwena wa irathiro, na mwena wa itherero hena Iria ria Itherero ( ), kana kuringana na mirorere, hena Antarctica ( ). Iria riri rihetwo ritwa kumana na India." },
        { "cell": "signs", "text": "Salim Young (Kanyundo) \"indo njega nĩ irĩ ene\" >> 5.3 million views" },
        { "cell": "signs", "text": "Jose Gatutura \"tũirio twega\" >> 4.6 million views" },
        { "cell": "signs", "text": "Samidoh na Joyce wa Mamaa \"wendo wĩ cama\" >> 4.2 million views" },
        { "cell": "dotted", "text": "Thutha-inĩ mwaka-inĩ ũcio, thutha wa kũheo gĩthomo kĩa University of Leeds nĩguo athome gĩthomo kĩa MA, Ngũgĩ nĩ aathire Ngeretha, kũrĩa aathire rĩrĩa ibuku rĩake rĩa kerĩ, The River Between, rĩathire mwaka-inĩ wa 1965. The River Between, ĩrĩa ĩkoragwo na Mau Mau Uprising ta mũthingi wayo na ĩtaaragĩria ũhoro wa wendo ũtarĩ mwega gatagatĩ ka Akristiano na andũ matarĩ Akristiano, nĩ yarĩ gĩcunjĩ kĩa mathomo ma thukuru cia sekondarĩ bũrũri-inĩ wa Kenya. Nĩ aatigire Leeds mwaka-inĩ wa 1967 atarĩ arĩkia thesis yake ya mabuku ma Caribbean, ĩrĩa athomeire ũhoro wa George Lamming, ũrĩa Ngũgĩ oigire ũũ ũhoro-inĩ wake wa 1972 mũcokanĩrĩrio wa ngathĩti Homecoming: \"Nĩ aanjĩtire, mbica ĩtarĩ ya kũriganĩrwo ya ũremi wa arĩmi thĩinĩ wa thĩ ĩrĩa ĩtongoragio nĩ athũngũ. Na o rĩmwe ngĩmenya atĩ no kũhoteke ibuku rĩa ng'ano rĩnjarie, rĩngĩteithie na ihenya, rĩhutie mĩhũmũ ya ngoro yakwa. Thĩ yake ndĩarĩ njũru harĩ niĩ ta ĩrĩa ya Fielding, Defoe, Smollett, Jane Austen, George Eliot, Dickens, D. H. Lawrence. \"" },
        { "cell": "dotted", "text": "Hungura Media U.K. >> 7.9 million views￼" },
        { "cell": "dotted", "text": "gĩtarũ-inĩ gĩa abrika no gũkoragwo na mĩahũ mĩigaige ta: p.c.e.a, redeem gospel, akũrinũ, lego maria, disciples of christ na ingĩ nyingĩ." },
        { "cell": "dotted", "text": "Biggie Smalls kana Notorious B.I.G arĩ mũini ngũthi kuuma bũrũri wa america. nĩ agwetetwo maita maingĩ ta ũmwe wa arang'ania anene mũno a kĩharo kĩa nyĩmbo cia hiphop thĩĩ yothe." },
        { "cell": "dotted", "text": "Mwaka wa 2016, gĩcagi gĩkĩ nĩkĩragwetirwo ta kũndũ kwega mũũno kwa gũtũũra thĩinĩ wa Amerika nĩ U.S. News & World Report." },
        { "cell": "dotted", "text": "Nyarũrũ Daniel Olorunfẹmi Fágúnwà MBE (1903 – 7 December 1963), arĩ na igweta ta D. O. Fágúnwà, ararĩ Mwandĩki kuuma Nigerian wa ũndũire wa Yorùbá ũrĩa ararungũririe waandĩki kũhũthĩra rũthiomi rwa Yoruba." },
        { "cell": "dotted", "text": "Òjó Aṣọ̀tán, co-authored with G.L. Lasebikan, published posthumously (London: Heinemann Educational Books Ltd., 1964) | Karũgano gakuhĩ" },
        { "cell": "dotted", "text": "L. L. Zamenhof [lower-alpha 1] (15 Disemba 1859 - 14 April 1917) [lower -alpha 2] aarĩ mũrigitani wa maitho ũrĩa watũũraga wĩra gĩcunjĩ kĩnene kĩa ũtũũro wake bũrũri wa Warsaw. Arĩ na gatũ makĩria ta mũũmbi wa rũthiomi rwa Esperanto, rũthiomi rwa gwĩtungĩra rũrĩa rũhũthĩrĩtwo mũno thĩ yothe." },
        { "cell": "era-marker", "text": "Иван Петрович Павлов ( Ivan Petrovich Pavlov ; 26 September [O.S. 14 September] 1849 – 27 February 1936) arĩ mũthomi na mũthuthuria wa mbũgĩ ũrĩa oĩkaine nĩ kũroroa mũtaratara wa ndereti ya rioki kũrĩ Bururi wa Rũraya akĩhũthĩra ngui ũthuthuria-inĩ. O ho nĩ anathũrima thaho ya biba ĩrĩa a tugĩirio Kĩheo ya Nobero kĩa ũrigitani." },
        { "cell": "year", "text": "ingũki cia ngigĩ gũtharara mĩgũnda ona yo nĩ yonekanĩte ica ikũhĩ(2020). ona nditi ya kĩmera kĩraihu kĩa waagi wa mbura kenya yanacama." },
        { "cell": "year", "text": "ũteti bũrũri-inĩ wa kenya kuuma wĩyathi-inĩ wake ona gwo nĩ ũcũngĩrĩirie nditi nyingĩ ta; ũragani, ũhahami na wanagi wa ng'ũndũ. itwĩka rĩa nduma biũ rũgano-inĩ rĩa kenya nĩ ngũi iria cia rũmĩrĩire gĩthurano kĩa 2007 ĩrĩa ya tigire andũ 1500 makuĩte na makĩria ma andũ 600,000 matarĩ wĩĩkaro." },
        { "cell": "year", "text": "Nairobi nĩ mucii ŭrĩa munene wa Kenya nanĩkuo mbunge irĩ, ningĩ nokuo Mũthamaki wa Kenya aikaraga. A'ngeretha moka Kenya matũire Nairobi town irĩa nene mwakaini wa 1899. Nairobi yatuĩkĩre mũciĩ mũnene ithenya rĩa Mombasa mwaka wa 1907. City ya Nairobi ihakuhĩ na rũĩ rwa Nairobi. Umũthĩ rũĩ rwa Nairobi rwĩ gĩko mũno na Mai Maruo matinginyuo. City ya Nairobi irĩ igũrũ mũno ta 1661 m (5450 ft)." },
        { "cell": "year", "text": "Terebiceni (kana 'runinga' na rũthiomi rwa Gĩthweri) ni mūtambo ũhũthĩkaga harī gūtūma ndūmīrīri cia mbica irathiī. Mītambo īno yambirie kũhũthĩka mīaka-inī ya 1920s, no nīyaikaragire kahinda ītambītie kwendio kūrī ahūthīri. Thutha wa mbara ya kerī nene ya thī( World War II), kūrī mūtambo waumire ūrīa wahūthīkire mūno mabūrūri-inī ma Unite States na Britain. Mīaka-inī ya 1950s terebiceni nīyo yarī mūtambo ūrīa wahūthīkaga mūno gūkinyīra mūingī. Terebiceni cia marangi maingĩ ciambirie kũhũthĩka mĩaka-inĩ ya 1960s gatagati-inĩ. Thiku ici nowĩrorere mbica cioyetwo mbere nĩũndũ nĩ kũrĩ na indo cia kũiga mbica icio ta DVD, flash drives, CD na video recorders. Rĩu kwĩna njĩra njerũ ya gũkinyirio maũndũ kwĩ mũtambo wa terebiceni kugerera digital transmission." },
        { "cell": "year", "text": "Rĩu kũrĩ mwaka wa 2017 nowĩrorere ceceni nyingĩ mũno ũrĩ gũkũ bũrũri-inĩ. Kwĩna ceceni cia maũndũ matiganĩte ta mohoro, mathako, ũhuthuria, mahunjio, mbiashara ona iria cia maũndũ ma gũkenia. Ceceni irĩa nyingĩ ni cia andũ kĩũmbe. Cia mathako ni ceceni ta Select Sport, Blitz, Select Sport 2, SS9 East,SuperSport 9 na Kwese Free Sport. Cia mohoro ni ta BBC Worrld News na KTN News TV. Nĩ kũrĩ cia mahunjio ta Family TV, Hope TV, Sayare TV na Aviation TV. Ceceni nyingi cia guku bururi-ini cinyitanĩirie maũndũ maya hamwe. Ceceni ici ni ta K24 TV, KU TV, KBC1, NTV, Meru TV, Heritage TV, Njata TV, KTS TV, KTN, Inooro TV, Gikuyu TV, Citizen TV, Baite TV, Kameme TV na Y-254. Thiteceni ici ĩtangathaga na thiomi cia Gĩthũngũ (English), Gĩthwaeri (Kiswahili), rũthiomi rwa imwana nĩrũo Theng'i (Sheng) na thiomi ingi cia andũ ngurani ngurani. Rũrĩrĩ rwa Gĩkũyũ nirurathimĩirwo gũkorwo na ceceni karundo ikimemerekia na rũthiomi rwao. Ceceni ici no ta Njata TV, Inooro TV, Gikuyu TV na Kameme TV. Ceceni ici niihotithitie mũndũ o wothe wa rũrĩrĩ gũkorwo agikinyirwo ni maũndũ ona atekũmenya wega thiomi in5gi." },
        { "cell": "year", "text": "\"Kanitha wa Jesũ wa ma\" nĩ kanitha wĩrũgamĩtie, wambĩrĩirio itũra-inĩ rĩa Beijing, bũrũri wa Caina, mwaka-ini wa ngiri ĩmwe magana kenda na ikumi na mũgwanja (1917). Ũmũthĩ, wĩna arũmĩrĩri ota gwata mirioni ĩmwe na nuthu, thĩiniĩ wa mabũrũri mĩrongo ĩna na matano, thĩ-inĩ wa thĩ ndaya ithathatu. Kanitha ũyũ umĩte thĩ-inĩ wa rũhonge rwa ũkristiano wa Pentecostal, rũrĩa rwa tungiruo mĩaka-inĩ ya kĩambĩrĩria, itĩna-inĩ rĩa mĩaka ya ngiri ĩmwe na magana kenda. Kuma mwaka wa ngiri ĩmwe magana kenda na mĩrongo kenda na mũgwanja-rĩ (1997), kanitha ũyũ nĩ wambĩrĩirio thĩ-inĩ wa bũrũri wa Afrika ya mũhuro. Matanyĩte kũhunjia ũhoro mwega kũrĩ thĩ ng'ima mbeere ya icoka rĩa keerĩ rĩa Jesũ. Ithomo nene cia kanitha ũyũ nĩ ta ũũ:" },
        { "cell": "year", "text": "Ngũgĩ Wa Thiong'o (1938 - 2025) arĩ mwandĩki mũkaru kuuma bũrũri wa Kĩrĩng'iga. Aarutire wĩra wa wandĩki wa Gĩthũngũ mbere ya kũgarũrũkĩra Wandĩki wa ruthiomi rwake rwa Gĩkũyũ." },
        { "cell": "year", "text": "Ngũgĩ aambĩrĩirie kwandĩka ibuku rĩake rĩa mbere, Weep Not, Child, rĩandĩkirũo Mĩĩ 1964. riu nirio riari, ibuku rĩa mbere rĩa kwandĩkwo na rũthiomi rwa Gĩthũngũ nĩ mwandĩki wa Afrika kuuma Afrika ya Irathĩro." },
        { "cell": "decimals", "text": "Abirika ĩ thiomi makĩria ma 2,000, iria arĩ gĩcunjĩ kĩmwe gĩa ithatũ gĩa thiomi ciothe cia thĩ. Thiomi imwe cia Abirika ta Gĩthwaĩri kwa mũhiano, kĩrĩa kĩaragio mabũrũriinĩ maingĩ ma Abirika ya Irathĩro na Abirika ya Gatagatĩ, ciaragio nĩ andũ makĩria ma mirioni 50." },
        { "cell": "decimals", "text": "Muigwithania 2.0 - First Kikuyu Newspaper revived on the Internet" },
        { "cell": "decimals", "text": "AIDS niyuragite andu million 3 na ti 570,000 ni ciana." },
        { "cell": "decimals", "text": "Curitiba (kuɾi'tibɐ) city irĩa nene ya Brazil. City ya Curitiba irĩ igũrũ mũno ta 934.6 m (3,066.3 ft)." },
        { "cell": "decimals", "text": "Concepción city irĩa nene ya Chile. City ya Concepción irĩ igũrũ mũno ta 12.0 m (39.4 ft)." },
        { "cell": "decimals", "text": "Sigino cia Digito - ni heni iria ikoragwo cigĩ kua ũhoro wa ndari(0,1) na kwogũo no cĩatwo Ndariri cia Ndarithii." },
        { "cell": "decimals", "text": "Nĩ Kautĩ ĩria ĩna andű angĩ műno gwĩ Kautĩ ĩria ingĩ. Ina makĩria ya andű milioni ithatu. Kurigana na KNBS Nairobi ina andu 3.1 milioni mwakaini wa 2010 ." },
        { "cell": "decimals", "text": "Wikipedia ya Malagasy rũthiomi rwaragio bururi wa Madagascar nĩyo wikipedia nene mũno ya thiomi cia kĩ Abirika. Nyarĩ na mathangũ 38,000." },
        { "cell": "ordinal-latin", "text": "inĩ matatu gĩikaro-inĩ kimwe. Bolt nowe wa mbere kuiga rekondi cia mita 100 na 200 gĩikaro-inĩ kĩmwe kĩa Olympics, na wa mbere gucinyitĩrĩra hĩndĩ ĩmwe kuuma Don Quarrie, muteng'eri o ungĩ kuuma Jamaica, urĩa wacinyitĩrĩire mwaka-inĩ wa 1974. Nĩ-undu woguo, njorua ĩno ya mahenya makuhĩ ĩheetwo rĩtwa rĩa itheru \"Lightning Bolt\" (Ruheni) nĩ andu aingĩ." },
        { "cell": "ordinal-latin", "text": "2. Ngurube P. Lwoga L. Knowledge management models and their utility and effective management and integration of indigenous knowledge with other knowledge systems. INDILIGA Journal vol 6 No 2. 2007" },
        { "cell": "ordinal-latin", "text": "3. Easton na Atuaria a handũ. Kũmananji gwa kũiyukania ,Thimo na ciambīki, thĩinĩ wa Bengi ya thĩ, ũũgĩ wa kimerera, tucira twa handũ twa gũthia na mbere ngirobo 2004." },
        { "cell": "ordinal-latin", "text": "1. Dosi G. Techinoronji paradigms and Tranjectories(Ciambĩki cia Tekinoronjĩ na njigerere), mwerekere wa ũtuĩria, 1982" },
        { "cell": "ordinal-latin", "text": "1. Artificial intelligence űguűki utarĩ wa nduire 2. Programming languagesThiomi cia gű programu" },
        { "cell": "ordinal-latin", "text": "3. Discrete mathematics 4. Algorithm (Ngorithimu)" },
        { "cell": "ordinal-latin", "text": "5. Electricity and magnetism (Thitima na űthimaku) 6. Digital Electronics" },
        { "cell": "ordinal-latin", "text": "7. Databasi thithitemu 8. Ndwari thithitemu" },
        { "cell": "units", "text": "Nĩwe warĩ mwena wa ũmotho wa timu kĩa bũrũri (Brazil) thutha ũcio agĩtuĩka mũrangĩri wa mwena wa ũmotho na nĩarĩ na ngumo cia kũgĩa na hinya na ugiginyani na kũhiũha na nĩarĩ mũndũ wĩna ũmenyo wa kũigana na arĩ na ũraihu wa inchi 24 (61 cm) . Mwaka wa 1997 nĩarĩ mũtongoria wa ũtengeri wa gĩthimo kĩa thĩ kĩa FIFA na mwaka wa 2004 nĩetĩirwo nĩ Pele thĩinĩ wa mũtaratara wake wa arĩa marakĩhũthagĩra makinya 100 (kĩruru kĩa makinya 100), Roberto Carlos nĩambĩrĩirie gũtua mũtaratara mũtaratarainĩ wa bũrũri mwaka wa 1992 nĩatonyire kĩhĩtahĩtano-inĩ kĩa thĩ, akĩteithia gĩthomo gĩake gũkinya mbĩtĩka ya mũico mwaka wa 1998 bũrũri-inĩ wa Faranja. O ho no athakagĩraga timu ya Real Madrid." },
        { "cell": "units", "text": "Croton macrostachyus nĩ mũtĩ mũthemba wa kĩthangũko. Kaingĩ nĩ ĩkoragwo na ũraihu wa mita 6 nginya 12, na rĩmwe nĩ ĩkoragwo ĩiyũragia mita 30. Nĩ ĩrĩ na thũmbĩ ĩrathambũrũka, ĩgathundũka, na ĩgathumbũrũka, na ĩrĩ na gĩthũri kĩa gĩthukĩ kĩrĩa kĩngĩkũra nginya 100 cm na ũraihu.&nbsp;" },
        { "cell": "units", "text": "Rũũĩ rwa Baro na njũũĩ ciaco irĩ na warie wa ta kilomita 41,200km. cia kĩgariũ. Kĩboo kĩa o mwaka wa rũũĩ rũu mũromo-inĩ nĩ 241 m3/s (8,510 ft3/s).&nbsp;" },
        { "cell": "units", "text": "wa cherry ũratwarwo nĩ rũhuho rũrĩa rũhurutaga ta 22 m/s (kĩruru gĩa 79 km/h kana 49 mph) ]]" },
        { "cell": "ranges", "text": "Jomo Kenyatta (Ngengi Kamau; 1891-1978) nĩwe president wa mbere wa Bũrũri wa Kenya. Athamakire kuuma mwaka wa wĩyathi wa 1963 nginya gĩkuũ gĩake mwaka wa 1978." },
        { "cell": "ranges", "text": "Herring, George C. America's Longest War: The United States and Vietnam, 1950–1975 (4th edition, 2001)." },
        { "cell": "ranges", "text": "Jahn GC. 2006. The dream is not yet over. In: P. Fredenburg P, Hill B, editors. Sharing rice for peace and prosperity in the Greater Mekong Subregion. Victoria, Australia: Sid Harta Publishers. p 237–240." },
        { "cell": "ranges", "text": "Karrnow, Stanley. Vietnam: A History. Penguin (Non-Classics); 2nd edition (1 June 1997). ISBN 0-14-026547-3." },
        { "cell": "ranges", "text": "Niels Bohr ( 7 October 1885 – 18 November 1962) arĩ mũthayatisti ũrĩa wa thondekire atomiki thiorĩ." },
        { "cell": "ranges", "text": "Erwin Schrodinger (1887–1961) mūndū wī ngumo nī gūthondeka equation ya mathabu īrīa ītūmagirwo kuonania harīa erektroni īri thīini wa atomu." },
        { "cell": "ranges", "text": "Komputa ya miainiframu ya nyaigagwo rumu ya waria wa fiiti ta 40x40. Komputa ino inayato miakaini ya 1985-1995 ni minithitiri ya kigina ya thirikari ya kenya." },
        { "cell": "ranges", "text": "Data ino ya namba cia mathangũ tuoire mathanguini ma muciĩ ma wikipedia 10-12-2012 iria" },
        { "cell": "currency", "text": "Mathaa 36 ituĩka-inĩ rĩũ, andũ atano nĩ maakuire: ũmwe nĩ aakuire nĩ kũrathwo nĩ arangĩri a Capitol , ũngĩ nĩ aakuĩte nĩ ũndũ wa kũhũthĩra ndawa nyingĩ mũno, na atatũ magĩkua nĩ ũndũ wa maũndũ ma ndũire, o hamwe na mũthigari ũmwe wa borithi.[ lower-alpha 2 ] Andũ aingĩ nĩ gurarire gatagatĩ-inĩ kao nĩ maabithaa 174 a borithi. Athuri a arĩa maacokire na mũnyamaro ũcio nĩ maakuire na njĩra ya kwĩyũraga thĩinĩ wa mĩeri mũgwanja. [1] July , ngarama cia mbeca iria ciarehetwo nĩ omokero rĩũ nĩ makĩria ma $2.7 million. [1]&nbsp;" },
        { "cell": "currency", "text": "Mũthenya wa 29 mweri wa gatano mwaka wa 1994, kamagĩra ya Mtongwe ĩrĩa yathia Likoni ĩkĩng'eũka ĩtigĩtie ũraihu wa mita 40 kuuma gĩcukĩro kĩa mũciĩ, na andũ 272 harĩ andũ 400 arĩa maarĩ thĩinĩ wayo magĩkua. Thutha wa ũgwati ũcio, nĩ kwarutirwo mũkana wa ũritũ wa mũthagano, Gũgĩgakinya 2005, KFS nĩ ĩrarĩhire mĩciĩ 81, na mũigana wa KSh.,902,472 (US$486,840).[1]" },
        { "cell": "currency", "text": "Mũthenya wa 17 mweri wa karine wa 2012, Henry nĩ aacokire Red Bulls nĩguo ategetherie mũhiano wa Mwaka wa 2012. Mũcara wake wa mũigana wa mirioni 5 ($ 5.6 million guaranteed) nĩ wamũtuire mũtongoria ũrĩa ũrĩ na mũcaara mũnene mũno MLS - akĩgarũra David Beckham, ũrĩa warĩ na mũcara wa kũhũrwo mwaka wake wa mũthia na Los Angeles Galaxy. &nbsp;&nbsp;Mwaka wa 2013, mũcara wa mũthingi wa Henry nĩ waahingire nginya thĩiniĩ wa mirioni 3.75 cia dollar, na akĩrũmĩrĩra mũcara wa mũcara wa mirioni 4 wa Robbie Keane. &nbsp;&nbsp;O na kũrĩ ũguo, na mbeca cia goro, Henry nĩ aathiire na mbere kũgĩa na mũcaara wa makĩria wa dolari milioni 4.35 kũgerera wa dolari mirioni 4.33 cia Keane.&nbsp;&nbsp;" },
        { "cell": "currency", "text": "kĩa Ũrũmwe wa Mabũrũr i (UN) ĩronania ng'ũndũ cia ndũnyũ (GDP) ya Thĩ ũmwe harĩ mũndũ (2024, PPP) >$60,000 $50,000 - $60,000 $40,000 - $50,000 $30,000 - $40,000 $20,000 - $30,000 $10,000 - $20,000 $5,000 - $10,000 $2,500 - $5,000 $1,000 - $2,500 ]]" },
        { "cell": "abbrev", "text": "Angĩkorwo nĩ waragia rũthiomi rwa Gĩgĩkũyũ no ũnyitanĩre na arĩa angĩ gũtheremia rũthiomi rũu. Tũma ndũmĩrĩri yaku ithangũinĩ rĩa ndereti (discussion page)." },
        { "cell": "abbrev", "text": "(Nokĩo gĩtagwo Kĩrĩma kĩa Yũ nĩ Embu na Mount Kenya nĩ Comba) Mũri wa Kiugo Kĩrĩnyaga uumĩte harĩ kiugo Nyaga kĩrĩa ũingi wakĩo nĩ Manyaganyaga kana Nyaganyaga. Kĩrĩma gĩa Kĩrĩnyaga kĩonekaga kĩrĩ na nyaga (Nyaganyaga)(gĩthwaĩri: \"madoadoa\") nĩ toondũ wa ira (gĩthwaĩri: barafu) rĩrĩa rĩkoragwo rĩnyagĩĩte tũthũrũmũndũ-inĩ (peak) twa kĩrĩma kĩu. Kĩrĩnyaga nĩ kĩrĩma kĩrĩa kĩna nyaga (spotted mountain). Ira thĩinĩ wa Bũrũri wa Kĩrĩnyaga ũrĩa ũikaragwo ni Agĩkũyũ rĩonekaga o kĩrĩma-inĩ gĩa Kĩrĩnyaga. Nĩ ũndũ Agĩkũyũ metĩkĩtie Ngai aikaraga Kĩrĩma-inĩ gĩa Kĩrĩnyaga, hĩndĩ ĩrĩa matekwenda kũmũtengũra, mamwĩtaga Mwene-Nyaga" },
        { "cell": "abbrev", "text": "Maĩ maingĩ maumaga kĩrĩma kĩa Mt.Kenya kana Mt. Kilimanjaro. Magagĩtherera njűĩinĩ, magaitĩka iriainĩ. Ningĩ maĩ nĩ maumaga mbura-inĩ, ona kana ithimainĩ. Maĩ nĩ ma bata műnene műno műtűrĩreinĩ wa indo ciothe cia thĩ ĩno. Kaingĩ maĩ matűmagĩrwo kűnyua. Ningĩ nĩmatűmagĩrwo kűrĩma mĩgűnda itű, ĩgagĩtűhe irio." },
        { "cell": "abbrev", "text": "ngumbaco: ici nĩ ciama nini kaigĩ ciũmbagwo na andũ a hũra ĩmwe kũrũmbũiya mĩhang'o yao. atumia a kanitha kana a itũũra, andũ a ndũthi, hamwe na arĩmi nĩ amwe arĩa makoragwo na ndereti ici. imwe cia mĩũngũrũrio iria citabanagio na ngumbaco ici nĩ; kuheana ngombo, kũbacĩrĩra gĩtatĩ(merry go round), kũcerera anyiti itemi(amemba) arwaru ona mathiko. thutha ũyũ ngumbaco cia nduthi nĩ rorererio kaara nĩ ndukũrano cia ikundi ngurani makĩrũĩrĩra imaamo, ningĩ ngumbaco ici nĩ irebotetwo kũtharĩkira ahũra angĩ a bara thutha wa mũtino." },
        { "cell": "abbrev", "text": "Mũndũ o wothe nĩ akenagio nĩ mwana wĩna mĩtugo mĩega. Ũũ nĩgũkorwo atĩ ciana ina mĩtugo mĩega nĩ huthu gũikaranĩa nacio na ciana ici iheaga mũndũ gĩtĩyo kĩrĩa kĩmwagĩrĩire. Mwana wĩna mĩtugo mĩega nĩ ũhũthũ kũmũtaara na kũmũcokia njĩra ĩrĩa yagĩrĩire ũkĩringithania na mwana wĩna mĩtugo mĩũru. Kuma hĩndĩ ya tene Mũgĩkũyũ nĩ arĩ na njĩra irĩa athomithagia mwana gũkorwo ena mĩtugo mĩega hĩndĩ ciothe. Njĩra ĩmwe ĩrĩa yahũthĩragwo nĩ andũ agima kũrũta ciana ũria ciagĩrĩirwo nĩ gũkũra itariĩ yakoragwo ĩ kũmaganĩra ng’ano. Ng’ano ciaganagwo hĩndĩ ya hwainĩ rĩrĩa andũ maranyihia hwai. Andũ agima nĩo maikaragia ciana thĩ makamahe kĩrĩra makĩhũthira ng’ano. Ng’ano ici maita maingi cianetwo “ng’ano cia marimũ’ tondu maita maingi ciana nĩcietĩkagia andũ aria akũrũ kũmakiria na matingĩamenyire atĩ ng’ano icio ti ũhoro wa ma." },
        { "cell": "abbrev", "text": "Ng’ano ciahũthĩkaga kũruta ciana gũkorwo me andũ mena mĩthiĩre ĩtarĩ na ũcuke. Rũgano rwa ũrĩa warũbũkũ ahenagia nyamũ ingĩ nĩguo eteithie we rwaheagwo ciana kũmonia atĩ ũngĩtuĩka hingo ciothe andũ nĩmekĩraga nganja maũndũ-inĩ maria wihokeirwo kana harĩa ũratuĩka nĩ ũhutanĩtie naho nĩkuonania atĩ ciĩko ciaku nĩ cia ũcuke. Ng’ano-inĩ nĩkuo gwakoragwo na motarii maũrĩa mũndũ agĩrĩirwo nĩgũikarania na aria angĩ. Nokuo mũndũ arutagwo mĩtugo ĩrĩa ĩtĩkĩrĩkĩte rũrĩrĩ-inĩ. Mũgĩkũyũ nĩekĩrĩiere mũno maũndũ ma ũndũire wake ta wathĩki, ũnyitnĩri, ũrũmwe na wohanĩri. Maũndũ maya mothe mathomithanagio kũhĩtũkĩra ng’ano na kĩrĩra kĩa rũrĩrĩ." },
        { "cell": "abbrev", "text": "Ng’ano nocio ciatũmĩkaga gũthomithia ciana ũgi wa mũtũrĩre na mĩtugo ĩrĩa ĩkenagia andũ. Maũndũ ta kũgĩa na ũcamba, kũmenyerera igweta, gũthikĩrĩria na gwĩkĩrĩra motaaro ma arĩa anene gũgũkĩra nĩ mamwe ma maũgi macio. Ciana nĩ icanjamũkaga nĩ ng’ano icio na ikaigwa irĩ njega mũno. Mĩtũrĩre ĩrĩa yaikaragwo nĩ arĩa marerirwo na ng’ano icio nĩyonanagia atĩ ti itherũ ng’ano nĩciarĩ na ũhoti wa gũthomithia andũ mĩtugo yakwendeka na yagwĩtĩkĩrĩka nĩ rũrĩrĩ." },
        { "cell": "abbrev", "text": "Mahinda magĩthiĩte macenjetiena o kinya mĩikarĩre mĩciĩ-inĩ ĩkagarũrũka. Ciana nyingĩ irĩ macukuru-inĩ igĩthoma nao aciari marĩ mawĩrainĩ magĩcaria ũboco wa kũrera na gũthomithia ciana. Mahinda magagĩkundera marĩa aciari na ciana monanaga na kũhota kwaranĩria. Ciana cia thikũ ici maita maingĩ irekora igĩcaria kĩrĩra kuuma ihumo ingĩ ta thimũ, arata aa marika mao ona karabiceni-inĩ. Nao andũ arĩa mena iheo mwanya mwanya ta arĩa mathondekaga gatuni magekĩra kio na makerutanĩria guthondeka mĩthako ĩra ingikenĩa ciana. Tutuni twa Disney films nĩ tumwe twa tũtunĩ tũrĩa tũĩkaine mũno na tũria tuonanagio mũno karabicenĩ-inĩ. Gatuni gaka ka Disney gakoragwo karongoreirie guthomithia ciana maũndũ maingĩ ta mĩtugo mĩega, gũikarania na andu na tũtuni tũngĩ tuthomithagia ciana maũndũ marĩa marahanĩka thĩ. Thinema-ici nĩcio ituĩkĩte cia kũgucĩrĩria ciana mũno tondũ ithondeketwo ci cĩa kũgucĩrĩria ciana." },
        { "cell": "latin-in-native", "text": "\"Ngai nĩ ahete Agĩkũyũ bũrũri mwega ũtagaga maĩ kana irio kana gĩthaka; Wega no Agĩkũyũ magocage Ngai mũno, nĩ ũndũ anamatanahĩra mũno.\"" },
        { "cell": "latin-in-native", "text": "Meta-Wikipedia/Meta-Vicipaedia | Wikitonary/Victionaria | Wikibooks/Vicilibraria | Wikiquote/Viciquotas | Wikisource" },
        { "cell": "latin-in-native", "text": "(For other large Wikipedias, look into the side-bar.)" },
        { "cell": "latin-in-native", "text": "Ndemokirathĩ nĩ kuga thirikari ya andu ĩthondeketwo nĩ andũ nĩ ũndũ wa andũ." },
        { "cell": "latin-in-native", "text": "Kauntĩ ya Kĩrĩnyaga nĩ ĩmwe ya kauntĩ mĩrongo ĩna na mũgwanja cia bũrũri wa Kenya. Kauntĩ ya Kĩrĩnyaga oro hau nĩ ĩmwe ya kauntĩ cia bũrũri wa Mũgĩkũyũ na ĩikaragwo mũnõ mũno nĩ Agĩkũyũ. Kĩrĩnyaga ĩriganĩtie na Nyĩrĩ, Embu na Mũrang'a." },
        { "cell": "latin-in-native", "text": "Gĩkũyũ nĩ ĩmwe ya thiomi cia kĩmerera bũrũri-inĩ wa kenya. kĩhumo gĩa rũthiomi rũrũ nĩ rũrĩrĩ rwa agĩkũyũ no nĩ rũthegeete ndũrũrĩ-inĩ iria cirĩ hakuhĩ na kĩrĩma kenya; icio nĩ amerũ, aembu, mbeere na tharaka nithi." },
        { "cell": "latin-in-native", "text": "nĩ kũrĩ na iganda cia ũharũkia nyingĩ iria ikinyangia ndũmĩrĩri na rũthiomi rwa gĩkũyũ, ta ceceni cia kameme, tv ona hamwe miro mĩerũ ya nenda cia ũkinyanĩria nĩcibacĩrĩirie itara cia kwambararia rũthiomi; ta viusasa, youtube, facebook ..na ingĩ nyigĩ. ceceni cia tũmeme na tv iria irĩ ngumo mũno nĩ; inooro, kameme, coro, njata na mt kenya." },
        { "cell": "latin-in-native", "text": "mwandĩki ũrĩa wandĩkĩte kĩbuku kĩrĩa kĩrahu mũno na rũthiomi rũrũ nĩ Ngũgĩ wa Thiong'o na kĩbuku gĩake \"Mũrogi wa Kagogo\"." },
        { "cell": "percent", "text": "Denver ( ) nĩ taũni na county ĩmwe, mũciĩ mũnene na itũũra inene mũno bũrũri-inĩ wa Colorado. Mũingĩ wayo warĩ 715,522 hĩndĩ ya Mũtaratara ũtari wa andũ wa 2020, na nĩ wongererekete na gĩcunjĩ kĩa 19.22% kuuma mwaka wa 2010. Yoete karungo ka 19 mũkũĩkũ-inĩ wa icagi iria ĩkoragwo na andũ aingĩ mũno thĩinĩ wa Amerika na nĩyo ya gatano harĩĩ mĩciĩ mĩnene ĩrĩa ĩkoragwo andũ aingĩ mũno mabũrũri-inĩ ma gwatanĩro ya Amerika" },
        { "cell": "percent", "text": "No 2% tu ya andũ arĩa matũũraga bũrũri ũcio nĩ maragia rũthiomi rwa Portuguese, rũthiomi rũrĩa rũnene, na gĩcunjĩ kĩa 33% nĩ rwaragia ta rũthiomu rwa kerĩ. O na kũrĩ ũguo, rũthiomi rwa mũtembanio(Creole) rwa Guinea-Bissau, rũrĩa rwĩtiranĩtie na rũthiomi rwa kĩportugeuse, nĩ rwaragio nĩ andũ aingĩ na nĩ rwatũmaga andũ magĩe na ũrũmwe. Kũringana na ũthuthuria wa mwaka wa 2012, 54% ya andũ nĩ maaragia Kĩcrioli ta rũthiomi rwao rwa mbere na 40% nĩ maaragia rũthiomi rũrũ ta rwa kerĩ. Andũ arĩa angĩ nĩ maaragia thiomi itiganĩte cia Abirika." },
        { "cell": "percent", "text": "Iria rĩgayanĩtio mabũrũri matatũ: Tanzania gĩcunjĩ kĩa 49% (), Uganda 45% (), na Kenya 6% ()." },
        { "cell": "percent", "text": "Kũgũrwo kwa 21st Century Fox n The Walt Disney Company wa inĩkĩrĩirwo mwerũ wa gatano wa mwaka wa 2019. Kũgerera indo ingĩ cia bata, kũgwatwo nĩ studio cia 20th Century Fox cia thinema na TV, itara cia cable cia Amerika ta FX, Fox Networks Group, gĩcunjĩ kĩa 73% kĩa National Geographic Partners, rũhonge rwa TV rwa India rwa Star India, na gĩcunjĩ kĩa 30% kĩa Hulu. Mũthenya ũmwe mbere ya kũgũrwo, 2 Century Fox nĩ yaarungũririe Kambuni ya Fox Broadcasting, Fox Television Stations, Fox News Channel, Fox Business, Fox Sports 1 na 2, Fox Deportes, na Big Ten Network na ĩgĩtuĩka Fox Corporation ĩrĩa yaambĩrĩirie kũgĩa. Indo ingĩ cia 21st Century Fox ta Fox Sports Networks na Sky nĩ ciathutũkirio na ikĩgurĩrio kũrĩ andũ angĩ ta Comcast na Sinclair Broadcast Group." },
        { "cell": "percent", "text": "Bũrũri-inĩ ' Brazil, Disney nĩ yaendaga kũongerera igai ria Coco ginya gĩcunjĩ kĩa 52% (kuuma 50% ya tene) na njũngwa imwe cia thinema ikĩtĩkwonania mbica icio. Thinema iria cionanirie Coco nĩ 618 kũringanithia na 919 iria cionithanagia Jumanji: Welcome to the Jungle ya Sony Pictures." },
        { "cell": "percent", "text": ".mw-parser-output .reflist{font-size:90%;margin-bottom:0.5em;list-style-type:decimal}.mw-parser-output .reflist .references{font-size:100%;margin-bottom:0;list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns-2{column-width:30em}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns-3{column-width:25em}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns{margin-top:0.3em}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns ol{margin-top:0}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns li{page-break-inside:avoid;break-inside:avoid-column}.mw-parser-output .reflist-upper-alpha{list-style-type:upper-alpha}.mw-parser-output .reflist-upper-roman{list-style-type:upper-roman}.mw-parser-output .reflist-lower-alpha{list-style-type:lower-alpha}.mw-parser-output .reflist-lower-greek{list-style-type:lower-greek}.mw-parser-output .reflist-lower-roman{list-style-type:lower-roman}" },
        { "cell": "percent", "text": "Watho wa thiomi wa Latvia ũkoragwo ũgĩtĩrĩnga rũthiomi rũrũ ta \"mũrũmbũ wa kĩndũire gĩa tene gĩa rũthiomi rwa Kĩlatvia\". Rũthiomi rũu rũhũthagĩrũo mũno bũrũri-inĩ wa Latgale, mwena wa irathĩro wa Latvia. Kũringana na mũtaratara wa ũtari wa andũ wa 2011 bũrũri-inĩ wa Latvia, andũ 164,500 thĩinĩ wa bũrũri ũcio, kana gĩcunjĩ kĩa 8.8% kĩa andũ, maaragia Kĩlagtania o mũthenya. 97,600 wao maatũũraga Latgale, 29,400 kũu Riga na 14,400 kũu kĩcigo kĩamũre kĩa Riga." },
        { "cell": "percent", "text": ".mw-parser-output .reflist{margin-bottom:0.5em;list-style-type:decimal}@media screen{.mw-parser-output .reflist{font-size:90%}}.mw-parser-output .reflist .references{font-size:100%;margin-bottom:0;list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns-2{column-width:30em}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns-3{column-width:25em}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns{margin-top:0.3em}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns ol{margin-top:0}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns li{page-break-inside:avoid;break-inside:avoid-column}.mw-parser-output .reflist-upper-alpha{list-style-type:upper-alpha}.mw-parser-output .reflist-upper-roman{list-style-type:upper-roman}.mw-parser-output .reflist-lower-alpha{list-style-type:lower-alpha}.mw-parser-output .reflist-lower-greek{list-style-type:lower-greek}.mw-parser-output .reflist-lower-roman{list-style-type:lower-roman}" },
        { "cell": "zero-width", "text": "Johannesburg ( , US o na /-ˈhɑːn-/ -⁠HAHN-,Afrikaans: ; Zulu na Xhosa: eGoli ) (no yo ĩtagwo, Joni, Jozi, Joburg, Jo'burg kana \"The City of Gold\") nĩ itũũra rĩrĩa rĩrĩ na andũ aingĩ mũno Abirika ya Rũgũrũ, na nĩ ĩmwe ya matũũra manene 100 ma thĩ. Johannesburg nĩyo njũngwa ya igoti ya thitango rĩtagwo Constitutional Court, igoti rĩa Kĩbũrũri rĩa South Africa. Tũthũngũri tũrĩa tũrĩ na ng'ũndũ nyingi ta thahabu na diamond tũrĩ itũũra rĩa Witwatersrand." },
        { "cell": "roman", "text": "Amerika ni nthi ĩrĩa ĩri amerika ya ĩgũru . Ĩvakanĩté na Kanada mwena wa ígúrú, Mexiko mwena wa ítherero . Îri na andú Milioni magana mathatu koguo ni ya kathatu nthí íría ina andu engí mûno nthi ngima.Ní nthi ya búrúrí 50 na Washington DC. Amerika ya thondekirwe mwaka 1776 ni makoloni 13 ma Uingeretha" },
        { "cell": "roman", "text": "Robert N. Wilkey, Vietnam’s Antitrust Legislation and Subscription to E-ASEAN: An End to the Bamboo Firewall Over Internet Regulation? The John Marshall Journal of Computer and Information Law, Vol. XX, Summer 2002, No. 4" },
        { "cell": "roman", "text": "James Peace nĩaikarire itũũra rĩa Bad Nauheim, bũrũri wa Nijĩrĩmani (Bundesrepublik Deutschland) kuuma mwaka wa 1991- 2009. Kuuma mwaka wa 1998, nĩekire ũthuthuria wa nyĩmbo cia mũthemba wa tango, agĩthondeka CD \"Tango escocés” (Tango ya Kĩscotish) ya nyĩmbo ciake cia piano iria ciatongoririo nĩ nyĩmbo cia tango, na mwaka wa 2002 nĩarĩ kĩama-inĩ kĩa Cukuru wa Ũini wa Victoria. Mwaka-inĩ ũyũ rĩ, nĩathiire iceera rĩake rĩa ũini e iika mwena wa rũgongo wa bũrũri wa Nijĩrĩmani kũrĩ mweri wa Kenda/ Wa ikũmi na mwena wa Irathĩro kũrĩ mweri wa Ikũmi na ĩmwe rĩrĩ agĩĩka moonanio make ma mbere ma \" Tango XVII” kũrĩa Hong Kong." },
        { "cell": "roman", "text": "Mwaka wa 1997, Jean nĩ aanyitire wĩra wa Destiny Child na makĩina rwĩmbo rwa \"No, No, No\". Thutha ũcio, nĩ aandĩkire ĩmwe ya nyimbo cia 1999 cia \"My Love Is Your Love\" (kwa Whitney Houston) na \"Maria Maria\" (kwa Santana). Rũmanjĩka-inĩ rwake rwa kerĩ rwa The Ecleftic: 2 Sides II a Book (2000), nĩ yarĩ na rwĩmbo rwa \"911\" (mena Mary J. Blige), na nĩ yaanyitire ngoga ya platini nĩ ngwatanĩro ya kũgathĩrĩria ya Amerika (RIAA). Rũmanjĩka rwake rwa gatatũ Masquerade (2002), nĩ yaacobehire ginya ikũmi cia mbere cia Billboard 200. Mwaka wa 2006, nĩ aanyitire ikinya rĩa mbere thĩinĩ wa Billboard Hot 100 ya Amerika, na akĩina rwĩmbo rwa \"Hips Don't Lie\" rwa Shakira. Nĩarĩa warĩ na rwĩmbo rwa karine ya gatandatũ ya studio, Carnival Vol. II: Memoirs of an Immigrant (2007), nĩ yaciarire rwĩimbo rwa \"Sweetest Girl (Dollar Bill) \" (na Akon, Niia & Lil Wayne) \". Jean nĩ aahũthĩrire kanitha wake wa \"Dar um Jeito (We Will Find a Way) \", hĩndĩ ya mũcemanio wa kũhingia gĩhĩtahĩtano kĩa FIFA World Cup 2014 bũrũri-inĩ wa Brazil." },
        { "cell": "roman", "text": "Frederick Gordon Brownell OMSS SM & Bar MMM KStJ (8 Mweri wa Gatatu 1940 - 10 Mweri wa Gicumi 2019) aarĩ mũrutani wa rũciaro, mũthomi wa maũndũ ma ndiĩ na mũrutani ũmwe wa maũthi rwa andũ a Abirika ya Mũhuro." },
        { "cell": "roman", "text": "Muthenya wa 6 mweri wa mbere wa mwaka wa 2021, Nyũmba ya Capitol ya Amerika, Washington, DC, nĩyaathikiririo nĩ kĩrĩndĩ kĩa andũ arĩa manyitaga mbaru Mũtirũkia wa Kahinda kau Donald Trump, mĩeri ĩĩrĩ thutha wa gũtoorio gĩtĩ-inĩ kĩa ũtirũkia kĩa 2020. Nĩ maageragia gũtirĩrĩa Trump hinyainĩ na njĩra ya kũgiria tabarĩra ya ũtari wa kura kũinĩkĩrĩra na gũkindĩra ũhootani wa President-in-the-elect Joe Biden . ." },
        { "cell": "roman", "text": "Mwaka wa ihũndũko Ghana 2019 nĩ kĩrungũrio kĩa ndamathia ya Ghana - hamwe na Adinkra Group ĩrĩa ĩkoragwo Amerika - kĩrĩa kĩendaga kũhe andũ a Abirika arĩa matũũraga mabũrũri ma mũrĩmo ngoro moke Afrika (na makĩria Ghana) gũikara na kũigithia mbeca mabũrũri-inĩ macio. Nĩ yambĩrĩirio na njĩra ya kĩama nĩ Mũtĩrũkia wa bũrũri Nana Akufo-Addo kwĩ mweri wa Septemba 2018 Washington, DC ta mũbango wa andũ a Abirika arĩa marĩ bũrũri-inĩ wa mabũrũri mangĩ kwaranĩria na andũ a Abĩrika. Mwaka wa 2019 nĩ wa kũririkanaga mĩaka 400 kuuma andũ a mbere a Afrika arĩa maarĩ ngombo maambĩrĩirie gũtũmĩka Virginia na kũngĩ , bũrũri-inĩ wa Amerika. [1] [2] Kuuma rĩrĩa Mũtĩrũkia Barrack Obama aathire Cape Coast mwaka wa 2009, andũ aingĩ mena ngumo nĩ maceerete Ghana kũona ũndũire wao. [1] Andũ aingĩ a Abirika a Amerika nĩ maamenyithanirie maũndũ mao megiĩ maũndũ marĩa meekĩte bũrũri-inĩ wa Ghana hĩndĩ ya Mwaka wa Ihũndũka." },
        { "cell": "roman", "text": "Sweden: Mũamũkĩri wa Ruby Jubilee Badge Medal of King Carl XVI Gustaf" },
        { "cell": "initialism", "text": "Hukabĩ no yo ĩũkaine ta mũkingo kana na kĩngeretha AIDS (Acquired Immune Deficiency Syndrome) ni ndwari uthukagia immune system kana kabĩ cia ngerewani. Mũndũ arinaguo nianyitagwo ni mirimu ingi na ihenya makiria." },
        { "cell": "initialism", "text": "Undu uria warehire mogaruruku maingi muno Kenya, ni mibango ya thirikari ya kwira TV ciother ithamire digital. Ona thutha wa mibango ino kuragwanwo nayo ni ene TV thirikari niyathire na mbere kuhinga miambo ya analogue. Hindi iyo nirio TV iria nene chiaregire kumemerekia ihinda ria thiku karundo makiregana na mibango iyo. Ona thengi ya kumenererio thirikari niyaregire gucoka thutha. Uthami uyu niwarehire mogaruruko maingi muno, na terebeni ikiongereka." },
        { "cell": "initialism", "text": "John Michael Talbot (aciarĩtwo mweri 8, mweri wa Gĩthathanwa, mwaka wa 1954, Oklahoma City Oklahoma) ni mwimbaji wa USA." },
        { "cell": "initialism", "text": "Tekinorojĩ cia Kombuita nĩ nĩteithagĩria maundu maigĩ twĩkaga na Tekinorojĩ iria ingĩ tũtũmagĩra ta cia thĩmũ, netiwaki, Microwave oven, DVD ya TV na igĩ nyingĩ." },
        { "cell": "initialism", "text": "Nĩhakanĩte na mabururi ma: Burundi, Uganda, DRC, Tanzania." },
        { "cell": "initialism", "text": "SWOT na Gĩthűgű nĩ Strengths, Weakness, Opportunities and Threats. Na gĩkűyű no ĩtwo űthuthuria wa gűtűmira űhoti, iremethia, mieke na iguoyohia." },
        { "cell": "initialism", "text": "SWOT nĩ ĩtũmagirwo gũthuthuria mũndũ, kambuni, ikundi cia iwanda, thithitemu, kothi mundu areka na maũndũ mangĩ." },
        { "cell": "initialism", "text": "KIRDI na gĩthũngũ kĩrũgamĩrĩre: Kenya Industrial Research and Development Institute na gĩkũyũ nĩ Kĩhandĩro kĩa ũtuĩria na ũkũria wa iwanda" },
        { "cell": "grouped", "text": "Wikipedia ya rũthiomi Yoruba rwaragio bururi wa Nigeria nĩyo wikipedia ya kerĩ kwa unene ya thiomi cia kĩ Abirika.Nyarĩ na mathangũ 30,000." },
        { "cell": "grouped", "text": "Wikipedia ya rũthiomi rwa Githweri rwaragio bururi wa Kenya na Tanzania na mabururi mangĩ nĩyo wikipedia ya gatatũ kwa ũnene ya thiomi cia kĩ Abirika. Nyarĩ na mathangũ 24,000" },
        { "cell": "grouped", "text": "Wikipedia ya rũthiomi rwa githweri rwaragio bururi wa Kenya nĩyo wikipedia ya gatatũ kwa ũnene ya thiomi cia kĩ Abirika. Nyarĩ na mathangũ 24,000" },
        { "cell": "grouped", "text": "Wikipedia ya rũthiomi rwa Lingala rwaragio bururi wa Zaire.. Nyarĩ na mathangũ 1,900." },
        { "cell": "grouped", "text": "Wikipedia ya rũthiomi rwa Kinyarwanda rwaragio bururi wa Rwanda.. Nyarĩ na mathangũ 1,800." },
        { "cell": "grouped", "text": "Guadalajara city irĩa nene ya Mexico. City ya Guadalajara irĩ igũrũ mũno ta 1,566 m." },
        { "cell": "grouped", "text": "Mexico City nĩ Mũcogi wa bũrũri wa Mexico. Mexico City irĩ igũrũ mũno ta 2,250 m." },
        { "cell": "grouped", "text": "Yangiabad city irĩa nene ya Uzbekistan. City ya Yangiabad irĩ igũrũ mũno ta 1,312 m." },
        { "cell": "signed-number", "text": "Kuringana na Gĩkara kia nobelprize kia rurendainĩ and aria maheo kiheo ni fĩthiki - 47, űthagia - 63 , kĩrira - 63 , űrigitani -38 , thayű - 62 na kĩa thayathi cia űcuumi -32[3]. Kwo ni kűri andű angi manaheo noberi." },
        { "cell": "signed-number", "text": "Mbere ya Mbaara ya Kerĩ ya Thĩ, nĩ aanyitanire na Ilmar Raud na Viktor Uulberg gĩcunjĩ gĩa gatatũ na gĩa gatano kĩa Estonia Championship ĩrĩa yaarĩ Tallinn mwaka wa 1933 (Gunnar Friedemann nĩ aatoorire), na akĩtorio nĩ Paul Keres mwaka wa 1935 (Paul Keres) (+1 -3 =0). Kibbermann athakĩire Estonia kĩhĩtahĩtano-inĩ kĩa Olympics ya Chess kĩarĩ Warsaw mwaka wa 1935 (+2 -5 =2).[1] Mweri wa ikũmi mwaka wa 1937, nĩ aanyitanire na mbĩtĩka cia ũmenyeru kĩaarĩ Tallinn (Keres nĩ ahotanire)." },
        { "cell": "signed-number", "text": "Matuĩka ma Arabu nĩ mĩkũĩkũ ya ũregi-ndamathia ĩrĩa ya hurunjĩte mabũrũri ma Arabu mĩakainĩ ya mbere ya 2010. Yambĩrĩire bũrũri-inĩ wa Tunisia ta icũgita rĩa gũkũmithia ungumania na ũtũũro kũritũha. Kuma Tunisia nditimũrano igĩthegea mabũrũri mangĩ matano Libya,Misiri, Yemen, Syria na Bahrain. Athani magĩthamakũrwo (Zine El Abidine Ben Ali wa Tunisia -2011-, Muammar Gaddafi wa Libya -2011-, Hosni Mubarak wa Egypt -2011-, na Ali Abdullah Saleh wa Yemen -2012-). Nditimũrano cia baara nĩ ciarĩ kuo na njĩra nene mabũrũri ma Morocco, Iraq, Algeria, Lebanon, Jordan, Kuwait, Oman na Sudan. Nditimũrano ninanini Djibouti, Mauritania, Palestine, Saudi Arabia na Western Sahara. Uuge ũrĩa wahũthagĩrwo kahinda kau nĩ Arabu aigĩ nĩ ash-shaʻb yurīd isqāṭ an-niẓām! 'Andũ makwenda kũgũithia ndamathia" },
        { "cell": "signed-number", "text": "Mũndũ Mũgo Immanuel Kant agwetire kahinda karĩa we atũraga (1724 -1804) ta kĩmera kĩa ũkenga (Aufklärung)." },
        { "cell": "signed-number", "text": "Ngarĩ (Panthera pardus) nĩ ĩmwe ya ĩtano ya rũruka rwa nyau ya gĩtĩrĩnge kĩa kĩratini kĩa Panthera. Ĩkoragwo na rũa wa marangi ma thahabu na maroro mairũ (mbirũ). Mwĩrĩ wayo nĩ mũceke wĩna macoka, ũkoragwo na ũraihu wa cm 92-183 (36-72 inchi), na mũcũnda wa cm 66-102 (26-40 inchi) na ũraihu wa ciande wa -70 (24-28 inchi). Arũme nĩ makoragwo na ũritũ wa kilo 30.9-72 (68-159 lb), na cia nga ikoragwo na ũritũ wa kg 20.5-43 (45-95 lb)." },
        { "cell": "signed-number", "text": "Joseph Ignatius Shanahan (June 6, 1871 -1943) aarĩ mũtongoria wa kanitha wa Gatoreki kuuma bũrũri wa Aĩũrĩa watungataga arĩ mũtongoria mũnene wa kanitha-inĩ wa ũrathi wa Niger ya mũhuro na Mũroti wa Nigeria ya Mũhuro (ũmũthĩ nĩ kanitha ya Onitsha). O ho Shanahan anatungata itĩna inini Nairobi." },
        { "cell": "signed-number", "text": "魯班 ('Ru Mbanũ na mũtamũkĩre wa Gĩgĩkũyũ) (–444 BC) arĩ njorua wa waaki wa mbaaũ, mũatĩrĩri na mũthindũri wa kuuma China." },
        { "cell": "letter-name", "text": "A former Nairobi resident's informal guide to the city" },
        { "cell": "letter-name", "text": "O ũrĩa mahinda marathiĩ na ũtaramu ũgathie ũkĩambatagĩra noguo kambuni irĩa irenda gũkorwo ikĩoa ikinya rĩa gũthomothia ciana maũndũ matiganĩte irathiĩ igĩũkaga na njĩra njerũ cia gũkinyanĩria kĩoneki kĩu. Andũ a marika ma nahau kabere magakĩũria ciuria kumana na motaaro na maũgĩ marĩa marakĩrutanwo thaa ici. No nao athomi makoiga atĩ o ihinda na maũndũ marĩo na atĩ kũringana na harĩa thĩ ĩkinyĩte ng’ano citingĩhota kũrũta ciana citũ mĩtugo mĩega. Nĩũndũ ũcio kambuni ta Disney nĩ igũthie na mbere gũkorwo ikĩnyita itemi inene mũno hari ũreri wa ciana cia mahinda maya tũrĩ." },
        { "cell": "letter-name", "text": "Gerekano ya macindano ma tekinorojĩ nĩ digital ĩrĩa ĩcidĩate ya Analogu. Ni ũndũ wa Tekinoronjĩ gũcindana nĩ kũrĩ marika ma Teknoroji, ta netiwaki ya thimũ cia mobailo nĩ kũri rika rĩambere (1G), rĩa kerĩ (2G), rĩa gatatũ(3G) na rĩa Kana(4G)." },
        { "cell": "letter-name", "text": "Tekinoronjĩ ya mũkaano yarĩkia gűthugudwo nyagĩrĩra ĩrűmĩrira műthiore űkuhĩrĩrie ndemwa ya S. Kiambiria Tekinoronjĩ ĩkűraga kahora, ĩgacoka ĩgakűra na ihenya műno, műiconi ĩgacoka ikajia gűkűra kahora. Gűkűra gwa Tekinoronjĩ nĩ kũga nĩ ĩrathia na mbere kwagĩrira." },
        { "cell": "letter-name", "text": "1. Cheung J. műkinyaniria wa iria ria bururu: Thoma kana ũtenyo, University of Mastricht , ndigirii ya muramati wa Thayathi, 2009, ĩrurendaini no charie." },
        { "cell": "letter-name", "text": "1. Anyamba T. Adebayo A. Traditional Architecture, Jomo Kenyatta Foundation 1993." },
        { "cell": "letter-name", "text": "Watho wa keerĩ: A body continues in constant motion unless acted by another force." },
        { "cell": "letter-name", "text": "McMahon, Robert J. Major Problems in the History of the Vietnam War: Documents and Essays (1995)." },
        { "cell": "exponent", "text": "Iria rĩa Mbogo (rĩrĩa tene rĩetagwo Lake Hannington) nĩ iria rĩna maĩ ma cumbĩ na rĩrĩ gĩcigo-inĩ kĩa volkano mwena wa mũhuro wa Iria rĩa Baringo, Kenya, na mwena wa rũgongo wa equator. Rũũĩ rwa Mbogo, o ta Iria rĩa Nakuru, Iria rĩa Elementeita, na Iria rĩa Magadi mwena wa rũgongo rwa Rift Valley, na iria rĩa Logipi mwena wa rũgongo, nĩ kũrĩ hĩndĩ rĩkoragwo na gĩkundi kĩmwe kĩnene mũno kĩa Nyoni cia Korogo. Rũũĩ rũu nĩ rũrĩ gĩcigo kĩa Ramsar na Lake Bogoria National Reserve cĩrangĩirwo nĩ rũhonge rwa National Reserve kuuma mũthenya wa 29 mweri wa ikũmi na ũmwe mwaka wa 1973. Iria rĩa Mbogo rĩkoragwo rĩtarie na ũriku wa mita 10, na rĩgakorũo na ũraihu wa kilomita 34 na wari wa kilomita 3.5, na rĩkoragwo na gĩthima kĩa maĩ kĩa kilomita 700². &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Nĩ ĩkoragwo kaunti-inĩ ya Baringo." },
        { "cell": "exponent", "text": "Ngirimbatũ (Rũraya:googol) nĩ ndari nene ya 10¹⁰⁰ kana ikũmi na thega wa igana. &nbsp;Ũhoro wa mũcanĩre ũtambũkagio na ibũgũ igana thutha wa ndari ya ĩmwe nĩyo 1 o ta ũ: 10,000,000,000,000,000,000,000,000,000,000,000,000,000,000,000,000,000,000,000,000,000,000,000,000,000,000,000,000,000,000,000,000,000." },
        { "cell": "arithmetic", "text": "Sudoku ( uːˈdoʊkuː, -ˈdɒk-, sə-/ ; Kĩnjabani: 数独, kuuga ndari o ĩmwe, mbere yetagwo gĩturwa kĩa handũ) nĩ mũthako wa ndaĩ ĩrĩa ĩhũthagĩraga ũgo gũtuithania itũrwa ngaru cia indo(kaingĩ ndari) gĩtama-inĩ . . Mũoroto wa Sudoku kũiyũria Kĩhengere kaingĩ kĩa 9 × 9 na ndari nĩ getha o kiriiko, o gĩtĩna na o ndaguro (cia 3×3) ũ atĩ ciothe ĩgũkorwo na ndari 1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8,9. Mũheani kagacwa wa ndaĩ ĩno ĩmerekia aihũrĩtie mĩanya iganona kĩhengere-inĩ. Ndaĩ njega ĩkoragwo na njokio o ĩmwe tu nũngarũ. Kagacwa kanini mũno kangĩruta njokio o ĩmwe kabatie gũkorwo na iturwa 17 nyumbũranie mbere." },
        { "cell": "ampersand", "text": "\"Whether you’re born and raised in Trinidad & Tobago, or you live abroad and was raised by Trinidadian parent(s), you’re going to know at least half of these sayings. These Trinbagonian idioms and analogies, proverbs if you may, have been passed from generation to generation, imparting the wisdom of the ages. It’s clear to see that wit and whimsicality has always been a part of the Trini experience.\"" },
        { "cell": "ampersand", "text": "kĩrĩa kĩ mũtaratara-inĩ wa &quot;ici&quot;" },
        { "cell": "ampersand", "text": "Threesome ft Chemical & Frida Amani (2022)" },
        { "cell": "ampersand", "text": "Wote ft Snake Fire, Barkeliam, DIZ Afrikana & Ray Medya (2021)" },
        { "cell": "ampersand", "text": "Alamba Chini ft Spice Diana, Gigi Lamayne & Ghetto Kids (2019)" },
        { "cell": "ampersand", "text": "Kiugo \"gũkiaboi\" kĩhũthĩkaga tu rĩrĩa mũndũ araaria ũhoro wa kũgarũra mũgambo ũrĩa warĩ kuo mbere, na kaingĩ nĩ ginya Rũthiomi rũngĩ. &#x5B; further explanation needed &#x5D;" },
        { "cell": "ampersand", "text": "(/prɑːɡ/ ['praɦa]; Czech: Praha [ˈpraɦa] i; German: Prag [pʁaːk] i; Latin: Prague) nĩ mũciĩ mũnene na itũũra rĩrĩa inene mũno bũrũri wa Czech Republic, na kuma tene no yo yarĩ mũciĩ mũnene wa Bohemia. Rũũĩ rwa Vltava, Prague nĩ mũciĩ wa andũ ta milioni 1.3. &nbsp;Itũũra rĩu rĩkoragwo na rĩera rĩhiũhĩte rĩa iria-inĩ, na nĩ kũrĩ hĩndĩ ya ũrugarĩ na ya heho." },
        { "cell": "ampersand", "text": "Ìrìnàjò, Apa Kiní & Apa Kejí (London: Oxford University Press, 1949) | maandĩko megie mĩgendere ya Fágúnwà's bũrũri wa Britain" },
        { "cell": "sports-time", "text": "David Lekuta Rudisha, MBS (ũciarĩirwo 17 Dicemba 1988) nĩ mũteng'eri kuuma bũrũri wa Kenya ũrĩa ena ũcorua wa iteng'era rĩa mita 800. Nĩ mũhotani wa Olympic maita merĩ kuuma London 2012 na Rio 2016, mũhotani wa thĩ mĩaka ya 2011 na 2015 mateng'era ma World Championships in Athletics, na nĩ ye ena Ngoga ya Ngĩrwa ya Thĩ na ihinda rĩa 1:40.91 rĩrĩa ahagĩkire iteng'era rĩa London 2012 ya Agosti 9, 2012. Rudisha we mũndũ wa mbere na wa nyũike kũhĩtũka mita 800 na thĩ ya 1:41 [1]" },
        { "cell": "sports-time", "text": "Mũthenya wa 18 Dicemba mwaka wa 2023 thaa 23:59:30 CST, gĩthingithia kĩa hinya wa 5.9-6.2 nĩ kĩaringire gĩkaru kĩa Jishishan, gĩcigo-inĩ kĩa Gansu, China. Thĩ yatũkire gĩcigo-inĩ kĩnene mũno kĩrĩa kĩrĩ mũhaka-inĩ wa bũrũri wa Gansu na Qinghai. Andũ 149 nĩ maakuire, 982 makĩgurara na angĩ 2 makĩũra icigoinĩ icio igĩrĩ. Ũcio nĩguo mũthingithia wa thĩ ũrĩa warĩ na ũgwati mũnene mũno bũrũri-inĩ wa China kuuma hĩndĩ ya mũthingithia ũrĩa waiyũririe gĩcigo kĩa Ludian mwaka wa 2014." },
        { "cell": "sports-time", "text": "Rita Jeptoo (aciarirwo 15 February 1981) nĩ mũteng'eri wa marathon Kenya. Ahootanĩte Marathon ya Boston maita matatũ, na akĩhagĩrka ngerua ya hĩndĩ ĩyo ya 2:18:57 mwaka wa 2014, nĩ aahotanire marathon cia Chicago, Stockholm, na Milan, na nĩ aatongoririe Kenya kĩharo-inĩ kĩa World Championships in Athletics mwaka wa 2007. Nĩwe ahotire ngerenwa ya gĩcango mbĩtĩka cia IAAF World Road Running Championships ya 2006." },
        { "cell": "sports-time", "text": "Catherine Nyambura Ndereba (aciarirwo 21 July 1972) nĩ mũteng'eri njorua wa ng'ong'o ndaya nĩcio marathon kuuma Kenya. Matiema ya mĩaka ya 2003 na 2008, nĩ arĩkirie ta ateng'eri eerĩ a mbere mateng'era-inĩ matano ma thĩ ma marathon. Ndereba nĩ ahotete ngoga ya marathon maita merĩ igwĩtwo World Championships in Athletics na akĩheo ngerenwa ya betha hĩndĩ ya mathako ma Olympic ma 2004 na 2008, na nĩ we warĩ mũhotani wa mbere wa gĩtarũ kia Abirika kũheo medal nyingĩ. Ningĩ nĩ ahotire maita mana Marathon ya Boston na maita merĩ Marathon ya Chicago. Mwaka wa 2001 nĩ guo aambĩrĩirie kũhũũra Rekodi ya thĩ ya marathon ya atumia na ihinda rĩa 2:18:47(Njororoko 315)." },
        { "cell": "version-dot", "text": "Ũkristiano nĩ ndini ĩrĩa ĩtirihĩte mũoyo-inĩ na mataro-inĩ ma Jecũ Kristo. kũringana na rũrenda rwa 'countrymeters', Ũkristiano nĩyo ndini nene ĩna arũmĩrĩri birrioni igĩrĩ gaturumo inya(2.6billion)." },
        { "cell": "version-dot", "text": "Ũtari wa andũ (mwaka 2019) ũraigire mũigana wa acũmarĩ Kenya ĩrĩ mirrioni igĩrĩ gaturumo mũgwanja(2.7million)." },
        { "cell": "version-dot", "text": ".mw-parser-output .reflist-columns-2{column-width:30em}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns-3{column-width:25em}body.skin-vector-2022 .mw-parser-output .reflist-columns-2{column-width:27em}body.skin-vector-2022 .mw-parser-output .reflist-columns-3{column-width:22.5em}.mw-parser-output .references[data-mw-group=upper-alpha]{list-style-type:upper-alpha}.mw-parser-output .references[data-mw-group=upper-roman]{list-style-type:upper-roman}.mw-parser-output .references[data-mw-group=lower-alpha]{list-style-type:lower-alpha}.mw-parser-output .references[data-mw-group=lower-greek]{list-style-type:lower-greek}.mw-parser-output .references[data-mw-group=lower-roman]{list-style-type:lower-roman}.mw-parser-output div.reflist-liststyle-upper-alpha .references{list-style-type:upper-alpha}.mw-parser-output div.reflist-liststyle-upper-roman .references{list-style-type:upper-roman}.mw-parser-output div.reflist-liststyle-lower-alpha .references{list-style-type:lower-alpha}.mw-parser-output div.reflist-liststyle-lower-greek .references{list-style-type:lower-greek}.mw-parser-output div.reflist-liststyle-lower-roman .references{list-style-type:lower-roman}" },
        { "cell": "quote-letter", "text": "Roho Mũtheru:\"Kwamûkîra kwa Roho Mûtheru, hamwe na ûira wa kwaria na thiomi ng'eni-rî, nîkûo kîmenyithia kîa igai riitû rîa ûthamaki wa igûrû.\"" },
        { "cell": "quote-letter", "text": "Wandĩki wake ũhutagia icuunjĩ cia wandĩki ta ng'ano, mĩthako ya ngerekano, ũhoro wa ciaca, ng'ano cia ciana na mangĩ maingĩ." },
        { "cell": "quote-letter", "text": "Mwaka-inĩ wa 1995, Ngũgĩ wa Thiong'o nĩ onekire arĩ na kansa ya prostate na akĩmenyithio atĩ aarĩ na mĩeri ĩtatũ ya gũtũũra; o na kũrĩ ũguo, nĩ aahonire. Mwaka wa 2019, nĩ aathondekirwo ngoro maita matatũ, na ihinda-inĩ rĩu, akĩambĩrĩria kũrũa na thĩna wa higo. Aakuire Buford, Georgia, Bũrũri wa Amerika mũthenya wa 28 Mĩĩ 2025, arĩ na mĩaka mĩrongo ĩnana na mũgwanja. Ihinda-inĩ rĩa gĩkuũ gĩake, Ngũgĩ nĩ aakoretwo akĩheo ũrigiti wa kũhũritũrwo ciĩga, no gĩtũmi kĩa gĩkuũ gĩake gĩtiamenyithirio nginyagia 28 Mweri wa gatatũ." },
        { "cell": "quote-letter", "text": "Castell'Arquato city irĩa nene ya Italy. City ya Castell'Arquato irĩ igũrũ mũno ta 224 m." },
        { "cell": "quote-letter", "text": "Fiorenzuola d'Arda city irĩa nene ya Italy. City ya Fiorenzuola d'Arda irĩ igũrũ mũno ta 80 m." },
        { "cell": "quote-letter", "text": "Lugagnano Val d'Arda city irĩa nene ya Italy. City ya Lugagnano Val d'Arda irĩ igũrũ mũno ta 229 m." },
        { "cell": "quote-letter", "text": "Monticelli d'Ongina city irĩa nene ya Italy. City ya Monticelli d'Ongina irĩ igũrũ mũno ta 40 m." },
        { "cell": "quote-letter", "text": "Ponte dell'Olio city irĩa nene ya Italy. City ya Ponte dell'Olio irĩ igũrũ mũno ta 217 m." }
    ],

    // The representative tier. Uniform stride over the same segments; keep it alongside the hard-set.
    "sample": [
        "Angĩkorwo nĩ waragia rũthiomi rwa Gĩgĩkũyũ no ũnyitanĩre na arĩa angĩ gũtheremia rũthiomi rũu. Tũma ndũmĩrĩri yaku ithangũinĩ rĩa ndereti (discussion page).",
        "Muigwithania 2.0 - First Kikuyu Newspaper revived on the Internet",
        "nyĩĩmbo cia reggea na bongo na gengetone reggea nĩ mũthemba wa nyĩĩmbo ciĩna kĩhumo bũrũri-inĩ wa Jamaica nacio bongo cirĩ mĩri Tanzania",
        "Jesũ Kristũ: Jesũ kristo owe kiugo ũrĩa wokire arĩ na mwĩrĩ, niakuire mũtharabaini niguo ahonokie ehia , na akiriũka mũthenya wa gatatũ na akiambata igũrũ matuini. Nowe wiki mũhonokia wa kirindĩ, ningĩ mũmbi wa igũrũ na thi, na nowe wiki Ngai ũrĩ wama.",
        "Atanagĩa uhotani uyu na rekondi ici, Bolt nĩarĩkĩtie kuonania uhoti wake mahenya-inĩ na kugĩa thahabu ya mita 200 mathako-inĩ ma World Junior Championships mwaka-inĩ wa 2002, na rĩngĩ mwaka-inĩ wa 2003 mathako-inĩ o macio. Mwaka-inĩ wa 2004, hĩndĩ ya mathako ma CARIFTA bururĩ-inĩ wa Bermuda, Bolt nĩ atuĩkire muteng´eri wa mbere wa mĩaka mĩnini guteng´era ihenya ma mita 200 na ihinda rĩa thĩ ya sekondi 20. Ahootire rekondi ya Roy Martin na akĩiga yake ya sekondi 19.93. Kuuma hĩndĩ ĩo nĩ athiĩte na mbere gukorwo arĩ muteng'eri njorua. Mwaka wa 2007 nĩ atuĩkire wa kerĩ mahenya-inĩ ma mita 200 na 100 relay mathako-inĩ ma IAAF World Athletics Championships muciĩ-inĩ munene wa Osaka, bururi wa Japan.",
        "San Pietro in Cerro city irĩa nene ya Italy. City ya San Pietro in Cerro irĩ igũrũ mũno ta 150 m.",
        "Kũgeria na kũhitia, ni mwikire ũtomagirwo harĩ maũndũ matari na ũũgĩ mũiganu. Mwikire ũyũ na thimo Kũgeria nĩ Kũhota ciĩ mũbarĩre wa maũndu ũrakararania, Kũgeria na Kũhota kana kũhitia ni mubarire wa gatatagi.",
        "Amerika ni nthi ĩrĩa ĩri amerika ya ĩgũru . Ĩvakanĩté na Kanada mwena wa ígúrú, Mexiko mwena wa ítherero . Îri na andú Milioni magana mathatu koguo ni ya kathatu nthí íría ina andu engí mûno nthi ngima.Ní nthi ya búrúrí 50 na Washington DC. Amerika ya thondekirwe mwaka 1776 ni makoloni 13 ma Uingeretha",
        "1. Artificial intelligence űguűki utarĩ wa nduire 2. Programming languagesThiomi cia gű programu",
        "Tekinorojĩ cia Kombuita nĩ nĩteithagĩria maundu maigĩ twĩkaga na Tekinorojĩ iria ingĩ tũtũmagĩra ta cia thĩmũ, netiwaki, Microwave oven, DVD ya TV na igĩ nyingĩ.",
        "Thailand Laws – Thailand acts and legal information, both in English and Thai language.",
